# Introduction
Azure Storage is Microsoft's cloud storage solution
Azure storage is  scalable and reliable solution that can handle high traffic and ensure data durability can restore data quickly if there's an outage.
Azure Storage offers a massively scalable object store for data objects. It provides a file system service for the cloud, a messaging store for reliable messaging, and a NoSQL store.
Azure Storage is also used by IaaS virtual machines, and PaaS cloud services.
Azure Storage as supporting three categories of data: structured data, unstructured data, and virtual machine data.
